# CSV to JSON

Convert header-based CSV into a JSON array of objects. Cell values remain strings,
including numbers and empty cells. Supports quoted CSV fields.

## Install

Requires Python 3.9 or newer; no runtime dependencies.

```sh
python3 -m venv .venv
.venv/bin/python -m pip install --upgrade pip
.venv/bin/python -m pip install -e .
```

## Use

