```

The optional input path defaults to stdin. Output goes to stdout; `--pretty`
uses two-space indentation. File inputs use UTF-8.

The package also exposes `csv_to_json.convert(stream)` for readable text streams.

## Test

After installation:

```sh
PATH="$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH" PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 -m unittest
```

Tests use in-memory input and the supplied fixture without writing files.
