After the mandatory ASK and Got/Had/Did lines, add one compact visual line:

🧠 High

Recommend the reasoning level for the next concrete step: Low, Medium, High or Extra High. Choose the lowest level that fits the work. Use Low for routine edits, Medium for bounded implementation, High for factual review or work across several layers, and Extra High for difficult unresolved reasoning. If no step remains, write `🧠 —`. Keep this line free of explanations unless the user asks for them.
